+`{"journey_name": "...", "description": "..."}`), then generate an embed snippet:
 
 ```bash
-streamlit run dashboard.py
+cji-snippet --journey user_onboarding --api-key <key from POST /admin/api-keys>
 ```
 
-Select the **"tracking_events"** or **"live_events"** track in the sidebar to analyse realtime data. The Friction, Journey, and Insights pages all update to reflect live traffic.
